OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and settled to start the
OL,6,Fnew week with light winds. Bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells emerging at times, though
OL,8,Fperiods of cloud also widely
OL,9,Fdeveloping throughout the day. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm where the sunshine breaks through.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome late brightness is
OL,13,Fpossible to end Monday, but generally
OL,14,Fa rather cloudy night to come. Staying
OL,15,Fdry throughout. Rather warm in urban
OL,16,Fareas but fresher in rural locations.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
